M.add(26639,"Two ways to satisfy a row: Add Service (on invoice) or Mark complete (now)",S,L,P,
 pre,
 ["On a due row, use Add Service and note it adds the canned lines and marks the row addressed on this work order.","Separately use Mark complete and note it resets at once.",
  "Confirm nothing infers a match from line text - the advisor states the work order satisfies the service.","Confirm an Add-Service row resets when the work order is invoiced; a Mark-complete row resets at once."],
 ["Every row offers two ways to satisfy it: Add Service (adds its canned lines to this work order and resets the service when the work order is invoiced) and Mark complete (resets it at once). Either marks the row addressed on this work order.",
  "Nothing infers a match from line text or canned lines; the advisor states that the work order satisfies a service and the system does not guess.",
  "A service whose lines were added resets when the work order is invoiced; a service marked complete resets at once."],
 [("S16-R13","Every row offers two ways to satisfy it: Add Service, which adds its canned lines to this work order, or at another location the same work per S16-N6, and resets the service when the work order is invoiced; and Mark complete, which resets it at once per S18-R6. Either marks the row addressed on this work order"),
  ("S16-R14","Nothing infers a match from line text or canned lines. The advisor states that the work order satisfies a service; the system does not guess"),
  ("S16-R15","A service whose lines were added resets when the work order is invoiced, through the step after invoicing. A service marked complete resets at once, per S18-R6")])
